<section class="section-shell service-questions" aria-labelledby="service-questions-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Working with us</p>
  <h2 id="service-questions-heading">Practical questions</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Can you work from rough notes or an existing presentation?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. We can start with notes, an existing deck, reports, interviews or data. We help identify the purpose and central message, then structure the material before designing the slides.</dd>
    <dt>Will the presentation be editable in PowerPoint?</dt>
    <dd>We offer PowerPoint-native design and production, with templates, quality assurance and handover. We agree the output around how your team needs to present, circulate and update the material.</dd>
    <dt>Can you help develop the argument as well as design the slides?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. Content review, narrative structure and message hierarchy are part of the service. We work with your subject experts to establish what the evidence supports and what the audience needs to understand.</dd>
  </dl>
</section>

